[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\r\n\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m I've read the presentation file! This is a fascinating talk about \"Engineering at AI\r\n  Speed\" for QCon San Francisco 2025.\r\n\r\n  The presentation tells three compelling stories from building Claude Code:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m🎯 Episode I: Rebuilding Input\u001b[22m\r\n  - Started with 333 lines of virtual Cursor class (Dec 2024)\r\n  - Evolved over 9 months through Vim mode, Unicode handling (graphemes, NFC), and\r\n  performance optimization\r\n  - Ended at 945 lines with 490+ tests\r\n  - Key lesson: AI + comprehensive tests made complexity manageable\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m🐚 Episode II: Reimagining Shell\u001b[22m\r\n  - Pivoted from PersistentShell (773 lines, sequential) to transient shells (346\r\n  lines, parallel)\r\n  - Discovered non-obvious \"snapshot\" pattern (310 lines) to capture user environment\r\n  - Total: 656 lines vs original 773, but way more extensible\r\n  - Enabled features like sandboxing easily\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m"]
[0.000, "o", "💀 Episode III: Reversing SQLite\u001b[22m\r\n  - Replaced working JSONL with SQLite\r\n  - 15 days from launch to complete removal\r\n  - Hit foundational issues: native deps, locking, migrations, version skew\r\n  - Reverted to 277 lines of simple JSONL\r\n  - Key lesson: Fast reversal is valuable\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mCentral thesis\u001b[22m: With AI, implementation cost → zero, so feedback loops become\r\n  everything. Ship continuously, make reversal cheap, and optimize for learning speed\r\n  over judgment quality.\r\n\r\n  What would you like to do with this presentation?\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m∴ Thought for 14s (\u001b[1mctrl+o\u001b[22m to show thinking)\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mPropaga\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mtin\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mg… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(\u001b[1mesc \u001b[22mto interrupt)\u001b[39m\r\n  ⎿  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mTip: Send messages to Claude while it works to steer Claude in real-time\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m> \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m~/.claude/t/wg8f40\u001b[39m                                          \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThinking on (tab to toggle)\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m-- INSERT --\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[?2026l"]
